WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.220
How did English education spread

2
00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.115
in India?

3
00:00:03.115 --> 00:00:05.305
Two documents set the course.

4
00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:08.971
Macaulay's Minute of 1835 favoured

5
00:00:08.971 --> 00:00:11.047
English education.

6
00:00:11.047 --> 00:00:14.129
Wood's Despatch of 1854 set

7
00:00:14.129 --> 00:00:15.905
out a system,

8
00:00:15.905 --> 00:00:19.613
and three universities opened in

9
00:00:19.613 --> 00:00:20.742
1857.

10
00:00:21.088 --> 00:00:23.319
Wood's Despatch is often called

11
00:00:23.319 --> 00:00:25.340
the Magna Carta of English

12
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.309
education in India.

13
00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.467
The topic also covers the

14
00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.867
vernacular press,

15
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:32.407
and the spread of modern

16
00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.445
science.

17
00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:34.954
Your turn.

18
00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:36.799
Which document?
